Quality Assurance (QA) Engineer

Job Summary:
Ensure that processes and systems are in place to deliver consistent product quality.
Key Responsibilities:
• Develop and maintain QA procedures and standards
• Monitor process compliance and quality systems
• Conduct internal audits
• Identify process improvements
• Collaborate with cross-functional teams
Required Skills:
• Knowledge of ISO 9001 standards
• Process-oriented thinking
• Documentation and auditing skills
Qualifications:
• Bachelor’s degree in Engineering or related field
• 0–2 years of experience 